=== luna_bus_arrival ===

# speaker: Luna

Well...

No turning back now.

~ ReceiveQuestAndStart("GrandpasFarmQuest")


-> END

=== luna_bridge ===

# speaker: Luna

I remember these irrigation channels.

Grandpa was always fixing them.

There was always another leak somewhere.

-> END

=== luna_broken_fence ===

# speaker: Luna

That fence has definitely seen better days.

Grandpa would have had that repaired before lunch.

-> END

=== luna_overgrown_path ===

# speaker: Luna

Everything grows so fast out here.

The path used to be clear.

Has it really been that long since I've visited?

-> END

=== luna_farm_first_view ===

# speaker: Luna

...

Wow.

I knew it would be rough, but...

It's worse than I expected.

-> END

=== luna_front_gate ===

# speaker: Luna

The gate's still here.

I used to swing on it when Grandpa wasn't looking.

He hated that.

-> END

=== luna_house_door ===

# speaker: Luna

Home sweet home.

Well...

Maybe not home.

Not yet.

-> END

=== luna_front_porch ===

# speaker: Luna

Grandpa spent hours sitting out here.

Watching the fields.

Watching nothing.

I never understood how he could do that.

-> END

=== luna_tool_shed ===

# speaker: Luna

If Grandpa left anything useful behind, it'd probably be in the shed.

Assuming the roof hasn't collapsed.

-> END

=== luna_before_entering_house ===

# speaker: Luna

Alright.

No more standing around.

Let's see what Grandpa wanted me to find.

-> END
